Elements of Information Security
	-Confidentiality
		Who can access it?
    	Assurance that only authorized personnel have access
    	Ex: Only you can see your bank statement
	-Integrity
    	Was it changed?
    	The trustworthiness of data or resouces with unauthorized changes
    	Your bank balance isn't altered from ₹50,000 to ₹5,000
  	-Availability
		Can I access it when needed?
    	Systems/data should be accessible when needed
    	UPI/banking service works when you need to pay
	-Authenticity
    	Is it really who/what it claims to be?
    	Proves genuineness/identity of the sources
    	You verify that an email really came from your bank
  	-Non-repudiation
    	Can they deny doing it later?
    	Provides evidence that an action/message really occurred (Proof of action)
    	A digitally signed document proves who signed it
